            "block_content": "An employee is diagnosed with Cancer on August 3rd and needs surgery to remove a malignant tumor. He/she is off for ten (10) weeks to recover from the surgery. The employee is able to return to work but needs to go for chemotherapy every other week for eight (8) weeks. The employee has the chemotherapy on Tuesday A.M. and is not able to return to work until Wednesday because of the side effects from the treatment. Working with Hartford, the employee's doctor would establish a follow-up treatment schedule.",
